# The dconf profile of the template-AUTHORING desktop ("hdw4s template edit").
#
# The ephemeral profile without the template's own database. The command seeds
# this session's user database from the template instead, so what the author
# sees is what a visitor would see, and a key the author resets is removed from
# the user database -- and so from the next template -- rather than falling back
# to the old template's value, which would make un-clicking a setting do nothing.
user-db:user
system-db:hdw4s-ephemeral
